@startuml
title cmp — Static example reader dependencies
component "Pilot host pages" as Pages
component "ExampleExplorer" as Explorer
component "Examples collection" as Content
artifact "Markdown sheets" as Sheets
component "Static build" as Build
artifact "Course HTML and bundled interaction" as Output
Pages ..> Explorer : uses
Explorer ..> Content : reads selected IDs at build time
Content ..> Sheets : validates and loads
Build ..> Pages : renders
Build --> Output : produces
note bottom of Output
No database or runtime content request.
Practice repository is an external reference.
end note
@enduml
